Package: migraph
Title: Install and Learn Social Network Analysis with the 'stocnet' Packages
Version: 2.0.0
Description: Helps new users install, update, and learn social network analysis.
   Attaching the package loads 'manynet' (network data and manipulation),
   'autograph' (plots), 'netrics' (measures), and 'infernet' (tests and models),
   and tells the user when newer versions of these packages are available.
   It provides interactive tutorials that cover all of these packages,
   and is the companion to 'Multimodal Political Networks'
   (2021, ISBN:9781108985000), whose datasets it includes.
URL: https://stocnet.github.io/migraph/
BugReports: https://github.com/stocnet/migraph/issues
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Language: en-GB
Encoding: UTF-8
